-- a value passed after the profile parameter is rejected
SETTING_CONSTRAINT_VIOLATION
-- the profile alone still applies
10
-- a value passed before the profile parameter is rejected too
SETTING_CONSTRAINT_VIOLATION
-- a parameter repeated around the profile is rejected on its last value
SETTING_CONSTRAINT_VIOLATION
-- a value within the constraint is still accepted
1000000000
-- a parameter equal to the value before the profile still overrides the profile
OK
